          %p
            We can promote
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi C
                    %mi fp
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi Grp
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C_{fp}(Grp)
            to a category with finite limits,
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi C
                      %mi fl
